// FITTED: GFGetWorld2DDistance(building pos, keeper pos) for the stall distance with the X-first body (opt-in FABLE_RETAIL_GFGETWORLD2DDISTANCE_X_FIRST: retail 0x007994A3 subtracts X first; FableWin /Od size 28i/73b of that text = 0x025B03E0); the implicit const char* -> CCharString speech argument (retail re-reads the temporary at 0x00799589); the early-return shape inside Ego_d's two if-blocks.
